airport-utils includes transformed airport and timezone data from Open Travel
Data (OPTD):

https://github.com/opentraveldata/opentraveldata

OPTD states that its curated and generated datasets are provided under the
Creative Commons Attribution license (CC BY):

https://opentraveldata.github.io/opentraveldata/

The bundled data is modified from the source dataset by filtering it to airport
records with three-character IATA codes, selecting timezone and geographic
fields, normalizing city names, and serializing the result for this package.

